{"id":12,"titleZh":"序曲与前奏曲","titleEn":"Overtures and Preludes","date":"1961-01-08","dateZh":"1961 年 1 月 8 日","concepts":"序曲、罗西尼渐强、前奏曲、单一速度","thesis":"序曲负责在开演前用多段情绪把剧场气氛点热，前奏曲则更简短集中，通常从头到尾维持同一种速度。","plain":"很多人最初爱上交响乐，靠的不是动辄四十分钟的大交响曲，而是痛快又精炼的歌剧序曲。序曲常常先慢后快调动兴奋感；而前奏曲（Prelude）紧连正文开场，规模更紧凑，往往通篇只保持单一的速度（或全快、或全慢、或中速）。","scenes":["拆解罗西尼《塞米拉米德》序曲的四块结构（急促开场、圆号慢板、小提琴碎步以及越来越响的“罗西尼渐强”），先分块示范再完整连演。","伯恩斯坦现场清唱对比三部歌剧前奏曲，证明前奏曲速度单一：快板的《卡门》、慢板的《茶花女》与稳健中速的《纽伦堡的名歌手》，最后指挥《莱奥诺拉第三》《牧神午后》与自写《坎迪德》序曲。"],"category":"基础乐理","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1gK4y1D7Wd","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gK4y1D7Wd","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 序曲与前奏曲","duration":"53:40","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/overtures-and-preludes","repertoire":[{"composer":"Rossini","piece":"Semiramide Overture","titleZh":"塞米拉米德序曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Rossini%20Semiramide%20Overture+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Rossini%20Semiramide%20Overture"},{"composer":"Beethoven","piece":"Leonore Overture No. 3, Op. 72b","titleZh":"莱奥诺拉第三序曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Beethoven%20Leonore%20Overture%20No.%203%2C%20Op.%2072b+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Beethoven%20Leonore%20Overture%20No.%203%2C%20Op.%2072b"},{"composer":"Debussy","piece":"Prélude à l'après-midi d'un faune","titleZh":"牧神午后前奏曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Debussy%20Pr%C3%A9lude%20%C3%A0%20l%27apr%C3%A8s-midi%20d%27un%20faune+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Debussy%20Pr%C3%A9lude%20%C3%A0%20l%27apr%C3%A8s-midi%2